<title>USA: Food Lion names new CFO.</title>
<headline>Food Lion names new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SALISBURY, N.C. 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Food Lion Inc said Monday it has named Laura Kendall chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Most recently, Kendall was chief financial officer of F &amp; M Distributors Inc, a discount health and beauty aids retailers.</p>
<p>She succeeds Dan Boone, who left the company in late August 1996.</p>
